    narr:narration """This hub tracks the strategic evolution of a [structured async decision platform](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform), a category defined by its explicit rejection of [real-time chat tools](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat). The initial vision, established in March 2026, focused on [remote teams of 10-50 people](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams) with a [base pricing model of $12/user/month](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars). 

By August 2026, the narrative shifted from abstract market positioning toward operational validation. Recent milestones demonstrate this transition, anchored by the [shipment of an async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_1) and a [record velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_2). The team attributes this performance to the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_3), which is framed as the critical unlock for recent delivery outcomes.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_1> ;
